                        "code": "NotificationService.Notify(new NotificationMessage() { Severity = NotificationSeverity.Info, Summary = $\"wait\", Detail = $\"try to update HelpDeskTicket and send email\",Duration= 8000 });\n                StateHasChanged();\n                //await Task.Delay(3000);      // flush changes - show Busy\n                //SomeLongSynchronousCode();",
